      "Key": "visit:4010"
    },
    {
      "Seq": 11,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Coast",
      "Area": "Square",
      "LocationId": 4010,
      "Actor": "Kenryc Greygate",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I find myself at noon in the heart of the village, tracks leading to the open dirt square, quarry sharpened for the hunt, prey marked, ready to take. I mark the thorn hedge, square-craft row, where thorns are set and pleached thick, drawing focus on the thorny run, ready for the quarry's take. I let my focus go, tracking no more, as the hunt's prize slipped away.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 0,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 0,
      "Key": ""
    },
    {
      "Seq": 12,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Coast",
      "Area": "Square",
      "LocationId": 4010,
      "Actor": "Kenryc Greygate",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I notice the thorn hedge, its thorns set in a square craft row, growing thick and pleached to protect. I wish to examine it closely, the scent of earth and thorn swelling to its point, the colour a deep green. I will rely on the plain ways of country folk, understanding that waiting has its price but is necessary to know when a thing is at its best.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 0,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 1,
      "Key": ""
    },
    {
      "Seq": 13,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Coast",
      "Area": "Square",
      "LocationId": 4010,
      "Actor": "Kenryc Greygate",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I wish not to delve into the thorn hedge's thorns, for I yearn to act, not to stand and stare. My hands yearn to plow, to sow, to tend the soil with care. My heart beats for the barn, for the fields, for the seasons' work.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 0,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 3,
      "Key": ""
    },
    {
      "Seq": 14,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Coast",
      "Area": "Square",
      "LocationId": 4010,
      "Actor": "Kenryc Greygate",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I will not linger by the thorn hedge, for it is not ripe for scrutiny, and I sense waiting past the hour would mar its essence. I can still examine the thorn hedge closely, another way. I will rely on the trapping and stalking of small game, for it is the time when their scent comes to its point, and the calm of knowing waiting has a price guides my steps.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 0,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 1,
      "Key": ""
    },
    {
      "Seq": 15,
      "Kind": 3,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Coast",
      "Area": "Square",
      "LocationId": 4010,
      "Actor": "Kenryc Greygate",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "Learned hedgecraft",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 0,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": null,
      "Key": "mm:Protagonist:hedgecraft",
      "Lesson": true
    },
    {
      "Seq": 16,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Coast",
      "Area": "Square",
      "LocationId": 4010,
      "Actor": "Kenryc Greygate",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I took the thorn hedge close, marking each thorn's curve. Thus, I learned its craft well, as quarry's run guides the hunter's path.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 0,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 3,
      "Key": ""
    },
    {
      "Seq": 21,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Coast",
      "Area": "Square",
      "LocationId": 4010,
      "Actor": "Kenryc Greygate",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I was once hiding from looters in such a house, its ivy climbing to the eaves, and now the ivy-grown house draws my attention, reminding me of my childhood spent at the farm, where the very same ivy clung to the timber-framed structure under a thatch. I let my focus go, where childhood memories of hiding from raiders drift, their echoes now in the rustling leaves.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 0,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 0,
      "Key": ""
    },
    {
      "Seq": 22,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Coast",
      "Area": "Square",
      "LocationId": 4010,
      "Actor": "Kenryc Greygate",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I observe the ivy-grown house, its swell and colour indicating it is just right. I want to examine its walls closely, and I will tend the fences and hedges to ensure my visit is as seamless as possible.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 0,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 1,
      "Key": ""
    },
    {
      "Seq": 23,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Coast",
      "Area": "Square",
      "LocationId": 4010,
      "Actor": "Kenryc Greygate",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I need not stand and observe the ivy's grasp, for my hands are steeped in thorns and stakes, ready to mend the fence where the wall's rotted. My eyes are sharp, the gap a dog will find before the sheep do.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 0,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 3,
      "Key": ""
    },
    {
      "Seq": 24,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Coast",
      "Area": "Square",
      "LocationId": 4010,
      "Actor": "Kenryc Greygate",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I will not examine the ivy-grown house wall closely, for it has its time and my patience has its limits, just as the scent of the old oak whispers its last, unspoken secrets. I could still examine the ivy-grown house wall closely, another way. My intent is to trust the trapping and stalking of small game, for I know waiting has its cost, but the hour is right, and the scent comes to its point on this coast.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 0,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 1,
      "Key": ""
    },
    {
      "Seq": 25,
      "Kind": 3,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Coast",
